  "synthetic": true,
  "notes": [
    "Hand-authored synthetic labeled dataset for AP-21 classifier calibration.",
    "No real client, ledger or model output was copied. Expected labels are human-authored calibration judgments, not measured facts.",
    "Scope is structural: proj-a and proj-b are different ledger namespaces.",
    "The 2-bit label encoding is not used or implied by this dataset; it is a transport convenience only.",
